#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Kini dibina di atas CEF/Chromium 148. Karere 4.0 menggantikan backend "
"WebKitGTK dengan Chromium Embedded Framework, membawa main balik lampiran "
"video penuh (H.264/AAC), sokongan berbilang akaun dengan sesi terpencil, zum "
"setiap akaun, dan enjin pemaparan yang lebih pantas dan lebih serasi sambil "
"mengekalkan shell GTK4/libadwaita natif yang sama."

